 a Necromancer that once was a noble heir, but was cast out for his practicing of Necromancy. A typical villain character, ruthless, merciless, and fanatic about raising the dead. After he had mastered the dark arts of Necromancy, he returned to his home and burnt down the house along with his family living in it. https://sta.sh/29gdmgde3jj?edit=1\nHer name is Vourecia, a bounty hunter that was abandoned by her original family because she was born a vampire, but later adopted by a nobleman. She could have lived happily with her new family until Vourekas ruined her life. https://sta.sh/2is2tuy7r12?edit=1\nTheir relationship is brother and sister.\n\nI don't have a specific scene in mind, so feel free to draw them as you like!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Kioku_michi/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/51596788/uploads/outputs/a7b406c0-848f-4a07-9cbe-692a77a783d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0e1b943451dd85fc2798d69076a4895f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51596788/uploads/outputs/a7b406c0-848f-4a07-9cbe-692a77a783d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0e1b943451dd85fc2798d69076a4895f, https://si.imgix.net/51596788/uploads/outputs/a7b406c0-848f-4a07-9cbe-692a77a783d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cfa43dd86752e20f58a8e203c8419232 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51596788/uploads/outputs/a7b406c0-848f-4a07-9cbe-692a77a783d8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=de2afe5642b4f5ad7b9a336ecd81091f 3x", "genre": "video", "nsfw": false, "